# HUMIDOR Price Service / UK Scanner Patch

Apply from the repository root:

    git apply HUMIDOR-price-service-settings.patch

Then run:

    npm install
    npm run lint
    npm test
    npm run build

This patch:
- adds a Price Service section to App Settings;
- adds safe server-side API configuration status (never returns API keys);
- makes the API health endpoint report Firecrawl/Gemini readiness;
- allows cross-origin API calls when ALLOWED_ORIGIN is intentionally unset (needed when a GitHub Pages frontend calls a separately hosted Vercel API);
- fixes VITE_API_BASE_URL trailing-slash normalization;
- provides in-app Vercel setup instructions and a Test connection button.

Required Vercel environment variables:
    GEMINI_API_KEY
    FIRECRAWL_API_KEY

If the frontend remains on GitHub Pages, also set the GitHub Actions repository variable:
    VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://YOUR-VERCEL-DOMAIN

Do NOT put GEMINI_API_KEY or FIRECRAWL_API_KEY in VITE_* variables, localStorage, or frontend source code.

